-- ============================================================
-- Note on thumbnails: the two seed rows above carry their EXACT
-- original thumbnail images, copied over as inline data — so
-- they display identically from minute one, with nothing to
-- re-upload. New projects you add from the dashboard will instead
-- get a real Supabase Storage URL, which works exactly the same
-- way (an <img src="..."> doesn't care which kind of URL it is).
-- If you'd rather these two also live in Storage, just open the
-- admin dashboard, edit each one, and re-upload its thumbnail —
-- that will replace the inline version with a Storage URL.
-- ============================================================
